detaileddescription.para:
Designed to be passed as the check_fn of a ReplicaValidationHandler registered with the DatabaseMaintenanceOrchestrator: autohandler=std::make_shared<ReplicaValidationHandler>(
[engine](){returnengine->runConsistencyCheck();});
orchestrator.registerTaskHandler(
MaintenanceTaskType::REPLICA_VALIDATION,
std::move(handler));
